---
title: Race Calendar
listKind: races
permalink: /events/
eyebrowText: On the calendar
eleventyComputed:
  intro: "{{ seasonRaces.length }} races on the {{ raceDates.season }} calendar.{% if raceDates.status == 'draft' %} These dates are a draft until the {{ raceDates.season }} calendar is approved.{% endif %}"
  description: "The PNWORCA {{ raceDates.season }} outrigger race calendar: {{ seasonRaces.length }} races across the Pacific Northwest, with dates, venues and host clubs."
---
{% from "macros.njk" import raceCard, arrow with context %}
<nav class="section-nav" aria-label="Races by type"><ul>
{% for t in raceTypes %}{% set n = 0 %}{% for r in raceCalendar %}{% if r.categorySlug == t.slug %}{% set n = n + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}<li><a href="/event-category/{{ t.slug }}/">{{ t.name }} ({{ n }})</a></li>
{% endfor %}</ul></nav>
{% set month = "" %}
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
{% for r in seasonRaces %}{% set m = r.date | monthYear %}{% if m != month %}{% set month = m %}<h2 class="cond" style="margin: {{ '0' if loop.first else '26px' }} 0 0; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; color: #1E2427">{{ m }}</h2>{% endif %}
{{ raceCard(r, summary=true) }}
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% set earlier = [] %}{% for r in raceCalendar %}{% if r.year != raceDates.season %}{% set earlier = (earlier.push(r), earlier) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if earlier.length %}
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<h2 class="cond" style="margin: 0; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; color: #1E2427">Not yet on the {{ raceDates.season }} calendar</h2>
{% for r in earlier %}{{ raceCard(r, summary=true) }}
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}
<section id="beyond-the-pnw" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-top: 26px">
<h2 class="cond" style="margin: 0; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; color: #1E2427">Beyond the PNW</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 640px">Major races outside the region that PNWORCA crews travel to. These are not PNWORCA events: check each race's own site for dates, entry and rules.</p>
<ul style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
{% for b in beyondRaces %}<li style="border-left: 4px solid #FDB714; padding-left: 14px"><a href="{{ b.url }}" style="font-weight: 700; color: #1E2427">{{ b.name }}</a> <span style="color: #4A4F57">{{ b.where }}</span><br>{{ b.text }}</li>
{% endfor %}</ul>
</section>
